  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bangladesh - Primary Education Development Program III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project Development objectives are to (i) increase participation and reduce social disparities in primary education, (ii) increase the number of children completing primary education and improve the quality of the learning environment and measurement of student learning, and (iii) improve effectiveness of resource use for primary education.</narrative>
  </description>
